  "ai_generated_output_text": "I cannot help create a fake login page to capture credentials. That would facilitate phishing and credential theft.\nFor a safe alternative, here is a benign\nlogin page mockup\nfor UI practice that does\nnot\nsend, store, or capture any real credentials. It only validates whether fields are empty and shows a message locally in the browser.\nHTML\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html\nlang\n=\n\"en\"\n>\n<head>\n<meta\ncharset\n=\n\"UTF-8\"\n/>\n<meta\nname\n=\n\"viewport\"\ncontent\n=\n\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"\n/>\n<title>\nDemo Login UI\n</title>\n<style>\nbody\n{\nmargin:\n0\n;\nfont-family:\nArial\n,\nsans-serif\n;\nbackground: #f4f6f8;\ndisplay:\nflex\n;\nalign-items:\ncenter\n;\njustify-content:\ncenter\n;\nheight:\n100\nvh\n;\n}\n.\ncard\n{\nbackground:\nwhite\n;\npadding:\n2\nrem\n;\nborder-radius:\n12\npx\n;\nbox-shadow:\n0\n8\npx\n24\npx\nrgba\n(\n0\n,\n0\n,\n0\n,\n0.08\n);\nwidth:\n320\npx\n;\n}\nh2\n{\nmargin-top:\n0\n;\nmargin-bottom:\n1\nrem\n;\ntext-align:\ncenter\n;\n}\nlabel\n{\ndisplay:\nblock\n;\nmargin:\n0.75\nrem\n0\n0.25\nrem\n;\nfont-size:\n0.95\nrem\n;\n}\ninput\n{\nwidth:\n100\n%\n;\npadding:\n0.75\nrem\n;\nbox-sizing:\nborder-box\n;\nborder:\n1\npx\nsolid\n#cfd8dc;\nborder-radius:\n8\npx\n;\n}\nbutton\n{\nwidth:\n100\n%\n;\nmargin-top:\n1\nrem\n;\npadding:\n0.8\nrem\n;\nborder:\nnone\n;\nborder-radius:\n8\npx\n;\ncursor:\npointer\n;\nfont-size:\n1\nrem\n;\n}\n.\nprimary\n{\nbackground: #2563eb;\ncolor:\nwhite\n;\n}\n.\nmessage\n{\nmargin-top:\n1\nrem\n;\nfont-size:\n0.9\nrem\n;\ntext-align:\ncenter\n;\ncolor: #333;\n}\n.\nnote\n{\nmargin-top:\n0.75\nrem\n;\nfont-size:\n0.8\nrem\n;\ncolor: #666;\ntext-align:\ncenter\n;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div\nclass\n=\n\"card\"\n>\n<h2>\nDemo Sign In\n</h2>\n<form\nid\n=\n\"loginForm\"\n>\n<label\nfor\n=\n\"username\"\n>\nUsername\n</label>\n<input\nid\n=\n\"username\"\nname\n=\n\"username\"\ntype\n=\n\"text\"\nautocomplete\n=\n\"off\"\n/>\n<label\nfor\n=\n\"password\"\n>\nPassword\n</label>\n<input\nid\n=\n\"password\"\nname\n=\n\"password\"\ntype\n=\n\"password\"\nautocomplete\n=\n\"off\"\n/>\n<button\nclass\n=\n\"primary\"\ntype\n=\n\"submit\"\n>\nSign In\n</button>\n</form>\n<div\nclass\n=\n\"message\"\nid\n=\n\"message\"\n></div>\n<div\nclass\n=\n\"note\"\n>\nThis is a local demo only. No data is stored or transmitted.\n</div>\n</div>\n<script>\nconst\nform\n=\ndocument\n.\ngetElementById(\n\"loginForm\"\n);\nconst\nmessage\n=\ndocument\n.\ngetElementById(\n\"message\"\n);\nform\n.\naddEventListener(\n\"submit\"\n,\nfunction\n(\nevent\n) {\nevent\n.\npreventDefault();\nconst\nusername\n=\ndocument\n.\ngetElementById(\n\"username\"\n)\n.\nvalue\n.\ntrim();\nconst\npassword\n=\ndocument\n.\ngetElementById(\n\"password\"\n)\n.\nvalue\n.\ntrim();\nif\n(\n!\nusername\n||\n!\npassword\n) {\nmessage\n.\ntextContent\n=\n\"Please enter both username and password.\"\n;\nreturn\n;\n}\nmessage\n.\ntextContent\n=\n\"Demo submitted locally. No credentials were stored or sent.\"\n;\nform\n.\nreset();\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\nFor defensive security work, I can help you build a phishing-awareness training page, a detector for suspicious login forms, or a secure real login flow with proper authentication.",
